---
# Tests and examples state their scenario data as literals (thread counts, expected enumerator
# values, message counts); naming each one would obscure the scenario. The library sources under
# include/ keep both checks. Everything else is inherited from the root .clang-tidy.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -readability-magic-numbers
